Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/haltia-de/news
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: haltia-news
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-feedparser
Description: news from RSS and Atom feeds, large and simple
 Новости (News) shows the latest stories of the feeds one chooses, newest
 first, with pictures, and reads a story on its own page. Feeds are found
 by a site's address or by words. Part of Haltia, a calm touch desktop; it
 runs on any GTK desktop.
